      "content": "omg it's getting worse. i tried to look down the drain with my phone light and i swear i saw something skitter away into the dark. like, i heard these tiny little scratching sounds, almost like little claws clicking against the metal pipes. it's not just a clog anymore, it feels like something is actually alive down there and just watching me from the shadows. what if it's something more than just a regular clog?? how do i know if i'm dealing with something... i don't know, more malicious? i'm actually shaking a little bit lol help!!",
